ect 24 7  and there was no room for her true  feelings or to deal with her mental  health issues  even though we now know more about what  really happened with ryan  deb admits that she capped her lowest  lows to herself  even though fans loved her active social  media presence  doug confessed she wasn't sharing much  about her true self  at first she tried to remain quiet about  the reasons behind their breakup  saying only that there was still love  between them and thanking fans for their  support  but ryan immediately threw dove under  the bus by blaming her for the split  he vented to the allegedly podcast that  the situation was really hard and that  he still loved her very much  and then he doubled up his accusations  not only did he blame dove for ending  their engagement but he accused her of  cheating on him first  despite this dove impressively managed  to stay positive  saying only that she felt better  stronger and more capable than she had  in years  in light of her breakup with ryan she  didn't even dignify his accusations with  a direct response  instead declaring that she was ready to  start showing up for life again  you know we all have exes ending her  relationship with ryan was one thing  but another major change in dove's life  was leaving disney  a lot of fans wondered if there was any  resentment when she pulled away from the  company that made her a star  but according to dove she's just  exploring different projects  she's compared leaving disney to moving  out of your parents house to go to  college  but admits it wasn't easy for so long  being a disney star had been a huge part  of her identity  and it caused her to question who she is  as a person but now that i'm not in it  who am i she didn't realize how much her  environment was connected to the  public's perception of her  but she hopes fans can look forward to  discovering dove the musical artist  but if you love seeing this star in  action don't worry although she's  throwing herse