 downsides  dove's struggles predate her time in the  spotlight i think i was depressed long  before i was famous  i think i was anxious long before i ever  even moved to l.a  instead of being afraid of the spotlight  she tries to use her platform to lift  other people up  she hopes being open about her own  issues will let others know that they're  not alone  dove admits to falling into the trap of  trying to appear perfect on social media  but if she could let everyone know one  thing it would be that there is nobody  in the world that ever has it all  together  um no matter how much they look like  they do despite all the craziness of  well the year 2020 dove's doing her best  to keep it together  two days ago i had like a massive  breakdown and i was like humans aren't  meant to be cooped up  she encouraged her fans to practice  self-care even if it's more therapy  sessions than splurging on face masks  dove also has a lot of support from her  partner thomas doherty and it seems like  things between them are going pretty  well  but is she the one like do you talk  about that  yeah yeah yeah she and thomas even  attended protests together  and you know what they say the couple  who protest together  stays together okay so they don't really  say that but maybe they should  we love that dove is taking charge of  herself and her career  and her happiness she's also letting her  fans in on even the less than perfect  moments of her life what do you think  about dove's career progression from  disney star to musician  do you appreciate her openness about her  struggles or do you think she's guilty  of over-sharing  let us know what you think about dove in  the comment section below and don't  forget to click on the subscribe button  for more new videos from us here at the  things  thanks for watching

